<title>USA: Seneca, Curtice Burns end acquisition.</title>
<headline>Seneca, Curtice Burns end acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pro-Fac Cooperative unit Curtice Burns Foods and Seneca Foods Corp said they will no longer pursue plans for Curtice Burns to acquire assets of Seneca's glass fruit business.</p>
<p>The companies said the decision was reached after the two companies completed the due diligence review prior to the acquisition.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
